SUMMARY:NOUVEAU RELEASE PARTY
DESCRIPTION:Happy International Nouveau Day! \nThe first taste of our 2026 harvest is ready just in time for the holidays\, and we’d love for you to be the first to try it at our Nouveau Release Party. \nTasting of the new 2026 Geodes is complimentary. Pili’s Party Taco Truck will be on site with food available to buy\, and a cash bar will be open all evening. This is a come-and-go gathering\, so there’s no table service. Grab a spot\, a glass of wine\, a taco\, and enjoy the music.
URL:https://butlerwinery.com/event/nouveau-release-party/
END:VEVENT
