SUMMARY:MONDAY TRIVIA NIGHT
DESCRIPTION:Think you know your stuff? Join us every 4th Monday of the month for Trivia Night with Rance Fawbush. \nTest your knowledge\, enjoy great company and sip your favorite Butler wine while you play.
URL:https://butlerwinery.com/event/monday-trivia-night-3/
END:VEVENT
