SUMMARY:UPLAND WINTER WINE MARKET
DESCRIPTION:Date and time: Saturday\, December 5\, 2026\, 12:00 to 5:00 PM \nLocation: Brown County Art Gallery\, corner of Artist Drive and Main Street \nDescription: Join Butler Winery and all nine wineries of the Indiana Uplands Wine Country for a holiday sip-and-shop afternoon with wine tasting\, art\, and the best in local artisans. Tickets are $35 (taxes and fees included) and include all wine tasting\, a souvenir wine trail glass\, and a tote bag. Add a tasting accompaniments plate with cheese\, meat\, crackers\, and more for $9. \nTickets: indianauplands.com \n 
URL:https://butlerwinery.com/event/upland-winter-wine-market/
END:VEVENT
