SUMMARY:WILD MOON YOGA
DESCRIPTION:Join Wild Moon Yoga to flow through 60 minutes of vinyasa style yoga before enjoying wine and social time with friends. All levels welcome. Contact Angie Kleptz at angie.wildmoonyoga@gmail.com \n \n  \nhttps://underthiswildmoon.com/scheduling
